abstract: >-
  Kalaris Labs is an applied AI research lab building recursive,
  self-improving agentic AI infrastructure for scientific discovery.
  We build systems for autonomous R&D, multi-agent orchestration,
  GPU-native execution, optimized inference, and reproducible
  research automation. Built from India for global science.
